Data Model
1. Purpose

This document defines the logical and analytical data model for the SAP HANA Sales & Inventory Intelligence platform.

The model is designed to separate transactional business concepts from reusable analytical structures.

2. SAP Source Concepts

The solution is based on common SAP SD/MM data concepts.

Sales

VBAK — Sales Order Header

VBAP — Sales Order Item

Customer

KNA1 — Customer Master

Material

MARA — Material Master

MAKT — Material Description

MARC — Material/Plant Data

Inventory

MARD — Storage Location Stock

The portfolio implementation will use synthetic/demo data.

3. Analytical Model

The analytical model contains dimension and fact structures.

Dimensions
DIM_CUSTOMER
DIM_PRODUCT
DIM_PLANT
DIM_DATE

Facts
FACT_SALES
FACT_INVENTORY

